	abstract = {This chapter presents a twelve-step approach for developing Asset Life Cycle Plans (ALCPs) to support strategic decision-making in Asset Life Cycle Management. The method integrates multidisciplinary perspectives through expert sessions, identifies lifetime impacts across Technical, Economic, Compliance, Commercial, and Organizational (TECCO) domains, and helps asset managers align long-term decisions with corporate objectives.},
